WEBVTT

00:00:00.315 --> 00:00:03.009
Use a fictional current draft and recipient reference

00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:06.872
with no approval record. The normal-path procedure cannot

00:00:07.096 --> 00:00:10.464
continue. Stop before sending and keep the draft

00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:13.923
unsent. Refer the missing evidence to the designated

00:00:14.058 --> 00:00:17.636
training reviewer. Record the version, missing approval, question

00:00:17.905 --> 00:00:20.421
and hold status in the permitted practice record.

00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:24.283
These are expected actions; preserve what your walkthrough

00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:26.828
actually does. If the reviewer is unknown in

00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:30.017
your project, flag that gap and pause the

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:33.431
affected action. Never treat silence or urgency as

00:00:33.565 --> 00:00:34.101
approval.
